2026-08-25T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-1021) '### Why the phase representation wins
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-1021) '
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Point  | Phase representation                      | The earlier local module               |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-1021) '| ------ | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Bind   | Adds phases. Cost is linear.              | Multiplies spectra. Cost is `n log n`. |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Unbind | Subtracts phases. Exact for every vector. | Exact only after a unitary correction. |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Atoms  | SHA-256 counter blocks.                   | A seeded normal draw.                  |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Parity | Matches a Python reference bit for bit.   | None.                                  |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-1021) '| Reuse  | Two repositories share it.                | One module in one repository.          |
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-08-25T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-1021) '
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD1021  1 LINE
 Text:Written

